{
  "fixtureId": "malformed-synthetic",
  "kind": "frames",
  "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
  "source": {
    "document": "WebSocket Streams for Binance — the documented payload blocks these frames deviate from; Binance Spot REST API — trade id typed LONG",
    "url": "https://github.com/binance/binance-spot-api-docs/blob/master/web-socket-streams.md",
    "accessedAt": "2026-08-27"
  },
  "notes": [
    "SYNTHETIC. The venue publishes no example of malformed traffic, so each frame here is a deliberate, single-property deviation from a documented shape. Nothing here claims Binance sends any of it.",
    "The point of the fixture is the ADR-002 §7 rule: an unrecognized value is first-class UNKNOWN, routed to a data-quality incident with the raw frame preserved — never a silent drop.",
    "`trade-unsafe-integer-id` is the BNC-U6 case: `9007199254740993` cannot be represented exactly by `JSON.parse`, so it is refused rather than carried as a rounded `venueTradeId`."
  ],
  "sequential": true,
  "frames": [
    {
      "label": "not-json",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "MALFORMED",
      "expectedClassification": "MALFORMED",
      "text": "PONG"
    },
    {
      "label": "empty-frame",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "MALFORMED",
      "expectedClassification": "MALFORMED",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "label": "truncated-json",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "MALFORMED",
      "expectedClassification": "MALFORMED",
      "text": "{\"e\":\"trade\",\"E\":1672515782136,"
    },
    {
      "label": "json-array",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "MALFORMED",
      "expectedClassification": "MALFORMED",
      "text": "[{\"e\":\"trade\"}]"
    },
    {
      "label": "json-scalar",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "MALFORMED",
      "expectedClassification": "MALFORMED",
      "text": "42"
    },
    {
      "label": "combined-wrapper-with-scalar-data",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "MALFORMED",
      "expectedClassification": "MALFORMED",
      "json": {
        "stream": "bnbbtc@trade",
        "data": "not-an-object"
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "trade-missing-quantity",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "MALFORMED",
      "expectedClassification": "MALFORMED",
      "json": {
        "e": "trade",
        "E": 1672515782136,
        "s": "BNBBTC",
        "t": 12345,
        "p": "0.001",
        "T": 1672515782136,
        "m": true
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "trade-numeric-price",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "MALFORMED",
      "expectedClassification": "MALFORMED",
      "json": {
        "e": "trade",
        "E": 1672515782136,
        "s": "BNBBTC",
        "t": 12345,
        "p": 0.001,
        "q": "100",
        "T": 1672515782136,
        "m": true
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "trade-unsafe-integer-id",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "MALFORMED",
      "expectedClassification": "MALFORMED",
      "text": "{\"e\":\"trade\",\"E\":1672515782136,\"s\":\"BNBBTC\",\"t\":9007199254740993,\"p\":\"0.001\",\"q\":\"100\",\"T\":1672515782136,\"m\":true}"
    },
    {
      "label": "book-ticker-missing-ask-quantity",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "UNKNOWN",
      "expectedClassification": "UNKNOWN",
      "json": {
        "u": 400900217,
        "s": "BNBUSDT",
        "b": "25.35190000",
        "B": "31.21000000",
        "a": "25.36520000"
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "undocumented-event-type",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "UNKNOWN",
      "expectedClassification": "UNKNOWN",
      "json": {
        "stream": "bnbbtc@kline_1m",
        "data": {
          "e": "kline",
          "E": 1672515782136,
          "s": "BNBBTC"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "object-matching-nothing-documented",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "UNKNOWN",
      "expectedClassification": "UNKNOWN",
      "json": {
        "hello": "world"
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "trade-non-positive-price",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "TRADE",
      "expectedClassification": "UNREPRESENTABLE",
      "json": {
        "e": "trade",
        "E": 1672515782136,
        "s": "BNBBTC",
        "t": 777001,
        "p": "0.00000000",
        "q": "100",
        "T": 1672515782136,
        "m": true
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "book-ticker-empty-bid-side",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "BOOK_TICKER",
      "expectedClassification": "NORMALIZED",
      "json": {
        "stream": "bnbusdt@bookTicker",
        "data": {
          "u": 777002,
          "s": "BNBUSDT",
          "b": "0.00000000",
          "B": "0.00000000",
          "a": "25.36520000",
          "A": "40.66000000"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "book-ticker-both-sides-empty",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "BOOK_TICKER",
      "expectedClassification": "UNREPRESENTABLE",
      "json": {
        "stream": "bnbusdt@bookTicker",
        "data": {
          "u": 777003,
          "s": "BNBUSDT",
          "b": "0.00000000",
          "B": "0.00000000",
          "a": "0.00000000",
          "A": "0.00000000"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "book-ticker-with-added-venue-fields",
      "provenance": "SYNTHETIC_DERIVED",
      "expectedKind": "BOOK_TICKER",
      "expectedClassification": "NORMALIZED",
      "json": {
        "stream": "bnbusdt@bookTicker",
        "data": {
          "u": 777004,
          "s": "BNBUSDT",
          "b": "25.35190000",
          "B": "31.21000000",
          "a": "25.36520000",
          "A": "40.66000000",
          "someFutureField": 1
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
